+    Only patch-IDENTIFYING names count (see :func:`_source_identity_tokens`):
+    the old probe appended the parent of every ``files`` entry — always
+    ``patches`` for dir entries — and used bare filenames, so a compose
+    mounting ANY patch dir matched EVERY install-script patch. The patch
+    id in the service body still counts (comments are already stripped).
+    """
+    return any(tok in body for tok in _source_identity_tokens(patch, root))
